## I. PEER GROUP DEFINITION

### A. Peer Selection Methodology

**BIST Telecom Universe:** Turkey has no dedicated telecom index (XUTEK is Technology, not Telecom). BIST-listed telecom operators:
1. **TCELL** (Turkcell İletişim Hizmetleri A.Ş.) — Primary subject
2. **TTKOM** (Türk Telekomünikasyon A.Ş.) — State-controlled, fiber + mobile
3. **Vodafone Turkey** — NOT publicly listed on BIST (Vodafone Group subsidiary, LSE: VOD)

**Peer Group Justification:**
- **TTKOM (PRIMARY PEER):** Only other publicly traded Turkish mobile operator on BIST; direct competitor in mobile + fixed broadband; comparable scale (TRY 242B revenue vs TCELL TRY 241B); both subject to same regulatory environment (BTK), same 5G auction participation, same TRY hyperinflation accounting (IAS 29)
- **Vodafone Turkey (SECONDARY PEER):** Not BIST-listed but essential for competitive landscape (36.6% market share, #2 position); financial data from Vodafone Group annual reports; comparability limited (euro reporting, different accounting calendar)

**Excluded Peers:**
- **TurkNet, Millenicom, Superonline:** Smaller fixed broadband/alternative operators; not comparable scale (combined <5% mobile market)
- **International Emerging Market Telcos (MTS Russia, Ooredoo, Zain):** Not BIST-listed; different regulatory/macro environments; comparability flagged as MEDIUM at best

**Final Peer Group:**
- **Tier 1 (Full Comparability):** TTKOM
- **Tier 2 (Moderate Comparability):** Vodafone Turkey
- **Tier 3 (Contextual Reference Only):** EM telecom sector benchmarks (median margins, leverage ratios)

**Source:** [Turkey Telecom Operators Intelligence Report 2025](https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/02/03/3231360/28124/en/Turkey-Telecom-Operators-Intelligence-Report-2025-Competitive-Analysis-of-Turkcell-Turk-Telecom-Vodafone-Turksat-and-Digiturk.html), [BIST XUTEK Index Components](https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BIST-XUTEK/components/)

